Subject: [PATCH 7/8] UI: DUSK colour theme

CONTRAST's base with muted track colours that move from purple and
pink to yellow and green: (178,156,226), (226,156,192), (220,204,132),
(156,204,150). It follows LO-FI in the COLOR list.

